OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FMary (86) has fallen over on her
OL,7,     Fhip and is rushed to resus,
OL,8,     Fparamedics blue-light in
OL,9,     F54-year-old Paul who's had
OL,10,     Fback-to-back seizures, and
OL,11,     F80-year-old Patricia struggles to
OL,12,     Fbreathe.
OL,13,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,14,     FFour top dermatologists treat
OL,15,     Fpatients for skin conditions such
OL,16,     Fas cysts, lipomas and skin tags
OL,17,     Fthat the NHS views as cosmetic,
OL,18,     Fbut that can hugely affect the
OL,19,     Fsufferers
OL,20,G0335 Home and Away
OL,21,     FLevi's bombarded. Sonny gets a new
OL,22,     Froommate. Zane spirals.
